{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54161","headline":"简寂观 · 秦韬玉","name":"简寂观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"物外灵踪客到稀，竹房斜掩旧荆扉。\n丹书万卷题朱字，碧岫千重锁翠微。\n泣露白猿携子去，唳风玄鹤傍人归。\n只应玉阙名长在，日暮闲云空自飞。\n（见《吉石庵丛书》本《庐山记》卷四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"秦韬玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54161.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54161","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}